&lt;strong&gt;Interactive Multi-Series Plotly Visualizations:&lt;/strong&gt; Historical sales actuals seamlessly stitched to 30-day TabPFN forecasts with a shaded translucent amber confidence ribbon representing the &lt;strong&gt;90% safety buffer ceiling&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
