&lt;h2&gt;


3 High-Converting B2B Cold Email Templates for 2026
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When writing outbound emails, keep your message under 120 words, focus on a single pain point, and make the call to action friction-free.&lt;/p&gt;

